        "id": "a-refused-simulated-answer-pauses-the-batch",
        "statement": "When Run refuses a simulated person's answer because the owner's credit or run quota ran out, the batch pauses with that reason instead of closing the trial; a paused batch answers nothing, and resuming it gives the answers still owed.",
